{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a5f39aa9dc5a833d95a8","chatId":"5cdfbb68507341cd9e412b60bfcc9254","sessionId":null,"userId":99013,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1438,"promptTokens":524,"completionTokens":130,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:41:39"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0059086578493855145,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a5f39aa9dc5a833d95a7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483699925,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:41:39","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a5f39aa9dc5a833d95a7","chatId":"5cdfbb68507341cd9e412b60bfcc9254","sessionId":null,"userId":99013,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n在一次知识问答挑战中，亚伦的队伍落后了。突然，一个来自他专业领域的问题出现了，亚伦迅速回答。他带着傻笑环顾了一下自己的球队，眨眨眼。他的回答被宣布是错的。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，亚伦最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 尴尬 & 失望\nB) 尴尬 & 开心\nC) 失望 & 开心\nD) 自豪 & 开心\nE) 好奇 & 开心\nF) 自豪 & 好奇\n\n## 问题 2\n亚伦为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 尽管他对自己的选择很有信心，他给出了错误的答案 & 他发现他对一个他专业领域问题的回答是错误的\nB) 他发现他对一个他专业领域问题的回答是错误的 & 亚伦知道那个问题的正确答案\nC) 亚伦知道那个问题的正确答案 & 他的队伍赢得了智力挑战\nD) 亚伦知道那个问题的正确答案 & 他的团队因他如此自信而欣赏他\nE) 他发现他对一个他专业领域问题的回答是错误的 & 他的团队因他如此自信而欣赏他\nF) 尽管他对自己的选择很有信心，他给出了错误的答案 & 在给出正确答案之前，他对他的队友们开玩笑地眨了眨眼","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0059086578493855145,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a5f39aa9dc5a833d95a8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483699923,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:41:39","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"8afe314c0c60414a990a898dfc334442"}